  "bodyHash": "b4b5e522e19a3643",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>欢迎使用 Sakura，这款模组&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">融合了竹子、WA与枫树。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/XmQ8N1SBjJKhFy6.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">本模组充满了日式风格，包含定食、寿司以及大量美食。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif\">使用武士刀和胁差体验全新战斗风格，在篝火和烹饪锅中进行烹饪。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif\">全新灾厄村民手持武士刀，将在竹林和枫树林中出没！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif\">新增服饰：和服、浴衣与羽织。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif\">尽情游玩吧~</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>官方宣传片：</strong></h4>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eaTCFOl_YyQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">游戏截图：</span></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/aoQGLIkAwTb5z9s.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1519\" height=\"792\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/g8k9wzsUV7ZBpAn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1114\" height=\"580\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/7N4ioG1OHFQwtb2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/i8OR6hEB2IXyDHA.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Syameimaru 的 Patreon 支持链接：<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/syameimaru_zheng\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/syameimaru_zheng</a></p>",
